      "line_num": 66,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#feature",
        "#kanban"
      ],
      "text": "**Inline TODO completion tracking: Snapshot-and-diff approach to detect when inline TODOs are removed between scans and show them as completed in the Done column. Uses `.todoscope-snapshot.json` and `.todoscope-done.json`. Git-history-independent \u2014 works on shallow clones.**\n`#feature` `#kanban`\n`TODO.md:L66`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 240
    },
