      "text": "<p style=\"--mb:8px\">To move an item to <strong>In Progress</strong>: move it under a <code>## In Progress</code> section in your TODO.md, or change the inline comment to <code># FIXME:</code>.</p>\n`scanner/templates/stream_results.html:240`",
